      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Chronic vulvar pain is a significant and misunderstood factor in women's health. Recent new definitions of chronic vulvar dysesthesia have helped to clarify the issue, however the etiology and effective treatment options remain elusive. A systematic approach to the diagnosis and treatment of vulvar dysesthesia is necessary for this difficult and challenging condition."},
